checkout with local changes.\n+UWLab 2.0 uses Isaac Lab **3.0 EA**, Isaac Sim **6.1**, Python **3.12**, and RSL-RL **5.4.1**.\n+For Isaac Lab 2.x / Isaac Sim 5.1, use the `isaaclab2` branch.\n \n ## Installation\n "}]}